# ROADMAP: Level 0 → Junior SOC Analyst (12–18 Bulan)

## Overview Phase

| Phase | Level | Durasi Estimasi | Fokus |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Phase 1 — Foundation** | 0–3 | Bulan 1–4 | Computer, Networking, Linux, Windows |
| **Phase 2 — Security Core** | 4–5 | Bulan 4–6 | Cybersecurity concepts, tools |
| **Phase 3 — SOC Basics** | 6–8 | Bulan 6–9 | SOC fundamentals, logging, SIEM |
| **Phase 4 — Detection & Response** | 9–13 | Bulan 9–13 | Triage, investigation, endpoint, threat intel, MITRE |
| **Phase 5 — Advanced SOC** | 14–18 | Bulan 13–16 | Threat hunting, IR, detection engineering, automation |
| **Phase 6 — Job Ready** | 19–20 | Bulan 16–18 | Simulasi penuh + portfolio + Security+ prep |

---

## PHASE 1 — Foundation (Level 0–3)

**Tujuan:** Paham cara kerja komputer, jaringan, dan dua OS utama (Linux & Windows) sampai level "nyaman pakai command line".

**Skill yang harus dikuasai:**
- Cara kerja CPU/RAM/storage/OS secara konseptual
- Proses, file system, user & permission
- TCP/IP, DNS, HTTP/HTTPS, DHCP, ARP, NAT, VPN, firewall, proxy
- Linux CLI (navigasi, permission, process, package management, networking commands)
- Windows fundamentals (Event Viewer dasar, services, registry dasar, PowerShell dasar)

**Tools:** VirtualBox, Ubuntu, Kali Linux (dikenalkan pelan-pelan), Windows VM, Wireshark (intro), terminal/PowerShell

**Checkpoint naik ke Phase 2:** Bisa install & konfigurasi VM sendiri, paham subnetting dasar, bisa navigasi Linux & Windows tanpa GUI untuk task dasar, paham perbedaan TCP vs UDP dan kenapa itu penting untuk security.

---

## PHASE 2 — Security Core (Level 4–5)

**Tujuan:** Paham konsep cybersecurity inti — CIA triad, authentication/authorization, common attack types, dan mulai pakai security tools dasar (Nmap, Wireshark serius, CyberChef).

**Checkpoint:** Bisa jelaskan attack technique umum (phishing, brute force, malware) dari sisi attacker DAN defender, bisa capture & baca traffic dasar di Wireshark.

---

## PHASE 3 — SOC Basics (Level 6–8)

**Tujuan:** Mengerti apa itu SOC, cara kerja logging, dan mulai pakai SIEM (Wazuh) untuk baca log real.

**Checkpoint:** Home lab Wazuh jalan, bisa generate & baca alert sederhana dari log Windows/Linux.

---

## PHASE 4 — Detection & Response (Level 9–13)

**Tujuan:** Alert triage sungguhan, investigation dasar, endpoint security (Sysmon/EDR concept), threat intel, MITRE ATT&CK mapping.

**Checkpoint:** Bisa terima 1 alert, cari log terkait, buat timeline, tentukan true/false positive, map ke MITRE ATT&CK.

---

## PHASE 5 — Advanced SOC (Level 14–18)

**Tujuan:** Threat hunting proaktif, incident response penuh, mulai bikin detection rule sederhana, automation pakai Python/Bash.

**Checkpoint:** Bisa simulasi IR dari awal (alert) sampai akhir (report + rekomendasi), bisa bikin 1 detection rule custom di Wazuh.

---

## PHASE 6 — Job Ready (Level 19–20)

**Tujuan:** Full SOC incident simulation, compile portfolio, mulai prep Security+ (baru mulai di sini, bukan dari awal).

**Checkpoint:** Portfolio lengkap 3–5 project, bisa handle simulasi incident end-to-end sendirian, siap apply Junior SOC.

---

